    basis: "prior: operator's scratch list-scheduling simulation, 2026-11-17, not in the tree. day 250, bound by the longest serial chain: six hard emitter nodes at 60 working days each; more parallelism does not move it, only decomposing those nodes into parallel units does"),
  estimate(subject: "v1-products-v1-free", made: d(y: 2026, m: 11, day: 17), start: d(y: 2027, m: 11, day: 2), done: d(y: 2028, m: 8, day: 8), pessimistic: d(y: 2029, m: 2, day: 28),
    basis: "prior: operator's scratch list-scheduling simulation, 2026-11-17, not in the tree. day 450 narrow, day 440 wide; the first-round end-of-2027 date assumed 4 to 8 weeks per deletion step, the simulation's v1 class is 30 working days and the chain after second-generation is seven serial units"),
  // THIRD ROUND, SAME DAY (operator, 2026-11-17: with the limit set by planning, dependency and decomposition rather than
